Subject to all conditions of this License, you are granted a worldwide,
non-exclusive, royalty-free permission to use, study, copy, modify and
distribute the Software for purposes other than Commercial Software Use,
and to create and use Generated Assets as permitted by Section 4.

For every use of GLGMesh code, including private, educational, research,
non-commercial, modified and redistributed uses, you must provide the
explicit attribution required by Section 5. Retaining a copyright notice
alone does not satisfy that attribution requirement.

When distributing the Software or any portion of its code, you must include
this License, retain copyright and third-party notices, identify your
